     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The rule of vowel inversion",
     "texto": [
      "Notice how the vowels are inverted compared with the present indicative: **parlare (indicative parla → subjunctive parli)**; **prendere (indicative prende → subjunctive prenda)**; **dormire (indicative dorme → subjunctive dorma)**.",
      "For noi it is always **-iamo** (parliamo, prendiamo). For voi it is always **-iate** (parliate, prendiate). For loro it is **-ino** (parlino) or **-ano** (prendano, dormano)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
